      "Abstract": {"AbstractText": "In the present study were described both the indications and protocols which are used in the main units of cardiac rehabilitation of Spain. The needs for a unification in the rehabilitation programmes was stressed. In fact, the author underlines the opportunity to create a national forum to establish the guidelines in this special branch of cardiology."},
